<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 15,900.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 15,900.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.15 vs   1.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.41 vs   1.45</p>
<p> Sales		    20.95 vs  17.31</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997	1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.78 vs   2.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.26 vs   3.66</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.78 vs   3.18</p>
<p> Sales		    81.37 vs  68.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat-processing company is</p>
<p>Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
